{"product_id":"akimbo-and-the-snakes","title":"Akimbo and the Snakes","description":"\u003cp\u003eAkimbo loves his life in Africa - he adores living in the game reserve where his father is ranger and he is able to see all sorts of wonderful animals. But he doesn't see many snakes, as they usually slither away when he gets close. But then his uncle asks if he would like to visit his snake park and Akimbo jumps at the chance!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Alexander McCall Smith\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780747586234\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45871453012121,"sku":"12RE9780747586234","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f164f8f126_Akimbo_and_the_Snakes.jpg?v=1762600142","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/akimbo-and-the-snakes","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}